Package: doudpackage
Title: Create Elegant Table 1 in HTML/'LaTeX' for Bio-Statistics
Version: 2.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Edouard", "Baudouin", , "edouardpierre.baudouin@aphp.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8324-6908"))
Description: Creates the "table one" of bio-medical papers. Fill it with your
    data and the name of the variable which you'll make the group(s) out of and
    it will make univariate and bivariate analysis, and parse the result into an
    HTML or 'LaTeX' table ready to paste into a paper.
